{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This free demo includes a slice of content from the full game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Tutorial:</strong> Learn the core mechanics and prepare to protect your magical flock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>First Area (50%):</strong> Explore half of the game's first region, filled with secrets, challenges, and atmospheric storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Introductory Puzzles:</strong> Solve environmental puzzles designed to teach and test your problem-solving skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Early Enemies:</strong> Face off against skeletal foes, including basic warriors and more advanced skeletal fighters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 of 3 Magical Sheep Types:</strong> Meet one of the three unique sheep you'll care for in the full game \u2013 each with their own abilities and charm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the beginning of a mystical journey and get a taste of what awaits in the full version!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840870/extras/bf39c8fb3697012f42cfd1f50b6b12e0.poster.webp?t=1751656174\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840870/extras/bf39c8fb3697012f42cfd1f50b6b12e0.webp?t=1751656174\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shepherd Knight is a game that places you in the role of a fearless shepherdess, a member of a noble order of shepherd knights. With your faithful dog by your side, your mission is to herd, guide, and protect your sheep while facing numerous challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840870/extras/574a25259737c24f4cd03df3f3f60506.poster.webp?t=1751656174\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840870/extras/574a25259737c24f4cd03df3f3f60506.webp?t=1751656174\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Path of Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a mystical world filled with forgotten ruins, ancient temples, and sacred lands. Guide your magical flock and loyal dog through breathtaking landscapes as you uncover relics and secrets of an order that saw sheep as guardians of spiritual balance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840870/extras/a2281818a2fd1601726710839532a1e9.poster.webp?t=1751656174\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840870/extras/a2281818a2fd1601726710839532a1e9.webp?t=1751656174\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Shield and the Flock</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your flock against relentless threats drawn to their magic. Wield your sword, command your companion, and face the dangers of a world where protecting your herd means preserving the legacy of the Shepherd Knights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840870/extras/3ae267598660c63cd56a7b6e8e1df9f6.poster.webp?t=1751656174\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840870/extras/3ae267598660c63cd56a7b6e8e1df9f6.webp?t=1751656174\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trials of the Shepherd Knights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve ancient puzzles tied to the sacred bond between shepherd, flock, and companion. Unlock hidden paths, recover lost memories, and piece together the forgotten story of a legendary order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840870/extras/1da7cc54fcb9fe877516bb863423f9d8.poster.webp?t=1751656174\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840870/extras/1da7cc54fcb9fe877516bb863423f9d8.webp?t=1751656174\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840870?t=1751656174","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840870?t=1751656174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840870/94ba3801b3ace8218815a1e6c66377d466acc5de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751656174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840870/94ba3801b3ace8218815a1e6c66377d466acc5de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751656174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This free demo includes a slice of content from the full game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Tutorial:</strong> Learn the core mechanics and prepare to protect your magical flock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>First Area (50%):</strong> Explore half of the game's first region, filled with secrets, challenges, and atmospheric storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Introductory Puzzles:</strong> Solve environmental puzzles designed to teac